{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1032851-session-reports-for-my-ctl-chronicle-chicago-changelings","id":1032851,"title":"Session reports for my CtL chronicle \"Chicago Changelings\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-16T12:49:21-08:00","id":1032851,"title":"Session reports for my CtL chronicle \"Chicago Changelings\"","content":"First of all, apologies if I posted this in the wrong forum - I didn't find any subforum for session reports from online games.<br /> <br /> Below you will find a link to a wiki page over on RPGGeek where I post the session reports for my ongoing Changeling: the Lost chronicle called Chicago Changelings. We've been playing for two years now and are currently at session #41. The game started off as a mortals nWoD game, until all the PCs were abducted by the True Fae and returned to Chicago two years later.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.rpggeek.com/wiki/page/Kai_Changeling\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpggeek.com/wiki/page/Kai_Changeling</a><br /> <br /> If you want to read the reports, a word of warning: they're very long, most of them between 3.000 to 5.000 words and they contain strong language.<br /> <br /> Enjoy and if you have any questions or comments, fire away! I'm always happy to hear other people's opinions or criticism - it's only through criticism that we learn and improve our gaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12887-kai-s","name":"Kai S.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-17T11:33:02-08